WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:16.080
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:26.100
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:35.810
"Sharp Words"

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.340
I heard from Zao.

00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:44.310
You haven't eaten anything in the past few days.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.200
I made some Thai style porridge.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:53.280
My mother used to make this for me when I didn't have an appetite.

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.670
I'm sorry but I don't want any.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.790
I liked going to school in Switzerland too...

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:04.880
...but I have an affection for Thailand where I grew up.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:10.060
There's a lot of great places in Thailand! 
 I can't wait to take you there!

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.990
Ling-Lee.

00:02:17.660 --> 00:02:20.380
Don't worry...

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:25.500
...I might be your little sister right now, but I know feelings change.

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.840
My father said so.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:35.040
I will change your mind!
 Can I not do that?

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:43.040
I'm sorry---

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:06.160
Mr. Zao, I would like to speak to Lee-Leng alone.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:11.690
Alright, I will wait outside.

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:14.490
Thanks for understanding.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.320
You look so sickly.

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:29.350
Lee-Leng, I admit I've been defeated by you.

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.760
I thought I could trust Kajika in your hands, but what is this about?!

00:03:36.490 --> 00:03:39.910
I didn't think you would put Kajika through this.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.990
What's happened has happened.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:47.610
I'm not that dull.

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:50.990
I can guess what has happened to you.

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:56.360
But, why have you given up?! 
 Why don't you keep fighting?!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.530
Carl, I---

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:04.120
Your operations and expansions were going so well.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:09.670
I was awed by your intelligence and talents.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.380
But look at you now.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:16.660
You're intimidated by your subordinate and you're not yourself anymore!

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:20.300
Maybe, that's your true self.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:24.120
If that's the truth I can't leave Kajika up to someone like that!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:29.020
Carl, why are you---

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.260
Well...

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:37.640
...I'm surprised myself, but I feel a sense of friendship towards you.

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:47.010
I heard His Highness Machaty is in critical condition.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:54.270
Don't you think Kajika wants you beside her right now?

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:11.110
His Highness Machaty probably only has this week to live.

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:14.700
Is that so?
 But...

00:05:15.520 --> 00:05:19.340
...why is he wanting to see Kajika?

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.720
Why would he call their name when he's barely conscious.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:27.190
Master Burnsworth is here.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:36.020
- Kajika. Harry.
- Rumaty.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.490
How is His Highness Machaty?

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:42.220
He's doing better, but---

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.730
He's not well, huh?

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:56.370
Rumaty, this is my grandfather Fred.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:06:03.230
I'm Fredrick Burnsworth. 
 Nice to meet Your Highness.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:09.010
Welcome, His Highness Machaty is waiting to see you.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:13.810
Anyway, please take us to His Highness Machaty.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:17.020
You're right.
 He's at Temple One.

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.320
Wait here Toranosuke.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.140
Machaty, Dad's real dad.

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.580
You loved Kathleen...

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:49.640
...and kept on searching for her to make her your Queen.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:56.000
But, you weren't able to make your dreams come true.
 Now you lay deep in the temple...

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.670
...and you're going to pass away alone?!

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:04.770
Only the high priest and the chosen can enter.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:10.450
But, today it is an exception since His Highness Machaty asked for you guys.

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:49.300
Master Kajika, please come close.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:06.280
This man is---

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:13.610
Come here.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:32.490
You've grown up to be so beautiful.

00:08:33.870 --> 00:08:35.840
My grandchild.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.990
Your Highness Rumaty, please hold your comments.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.620
- I will explain this to you later.
- High Priest---

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:53.390
You guys---

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.700
Fred...

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.650
- ...are you here? 
 - I'm here.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:04.060
It's been 55 years...

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:08.300
...we both aged so much.

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:13.620
I wasn't able to follow through with my promise.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:18.460
Fred, I'll be back to get Kathleen.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:21.610
Until then, I'm counting on you my friend!

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:28.120
But, you kept your promise.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:34.100
Fred, I'm...

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:38.520
...happy that I'm able to see you again.

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.430
Machaty, I'm happy too.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:49.710
55 years ago, I met her for the first time.

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:55.320
Until that day, I felt as though I was dead.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:01.340
But, from that day on I...

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:04.330
...felt like I was alive!

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:11.640
My life is almost coming to an end.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.550
Fred, I have no regrets.

00:10:17.670 --> 00:10:22.030
I loved Kathleen and wanted her to be my wife...

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.390
...but, she left me.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:31.050
I realized that was her way of showing her love to me.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:38.790
She spent her whole life to give me unconditional love.

00:10:39.310 --> 00:10:42.410
The remnants of her love is you guys.

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:47.490
There is no way that you guys won't find happiness.

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:53.020
I will continue to pray that you may find joy.

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:58.730
My beloved children.

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:03.270
Do not hesitate.

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:12.010
I suggest that you go all in on someone you love too.

00:11:14.500 --> 00:11:17.220
Don't hesitate.

00:11:18.980 --> 00:11:20.960
Kajika.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.420
Machaty.

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:56.560
I still can't believe that Harry is my uncle...

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:01.800
-...and Kajika's my cousin. 
- I was just recently told about this too.

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:07.100
- Najayra's mom told me. 
- Aunt Ririka did?

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:11.000
Is that so?

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:15.990
If it had turned out the way it was supposed to, you would have been king, Harry.

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:19.020
And Kajika was supposed to be the Queen.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.800
Your Highness, you no longer need to say anything.

00:12:23.690 --> 00:12:29.970
My wish is that you will become a great king beyond that of Machaty.

00:12:34.490 --> 00:12:37.910
Kathleen really loved Fred.

00:12:38.430 --> 00:12:41.730
But, she always loved Machaty too.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:46.680
I just wanted Machaty to know that, but...

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:50.490
...there was no need to tell him that.

00:12:52.970 --> 00:12:56.100
I'm so grateful to have met him.

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:01.250
<i>Don't hesitate.</i>

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:05.740
He gave me a lot of courage.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:14.570
Dad, I have something to ask you. 
 Please cut ties with me.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:21.290
- Kajika! 
- I want to leave the Burnsworth name behind me.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:27.210
I don't need to be the heir. 
 I just want to be Kajika and pursue what I want to pursue!

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:36.770
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:40.530
Master Kajika! 
 What are you saying?!

00:13:43.360 --> 00:13:47.090
- Alright. I'm cutting ties with you. 
- What?!

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:50.940
You may no longer go by the Burnsworth name.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.710
But, I will give you Givoli Island.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:59.260
This is called having grace on you.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:08.020
I love you Dad.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:22.640
- Master Kajika!
- Toranosuke, your contract is up now.

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:25.150
Thank you for protecting her all this time.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.020
Alright. I understand.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:36.460
I will protect Master Kajika on my free will. 
 Excuse me.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:45.890
He gave Kajika freedom by getting rid of the Burnsworth name.

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:49.970
On the other hand, she's running towards her dreams.

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:54.560
He knows that neither Toranosuke or I can leave her alone.

00:14:58.090 --> 00:14:59.430
What a man.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:07.780
I'm comforted to know that I have the same blood running through me as you do, Uncle.

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.620
It's an honor to hear that.

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:28.640
You can't love her in a normal way.

00:15:28.890 --> 00:15:33.450
To love her, you must be willing to sacrifice yourself.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.700
With that said, you can no longer be considered one of the candidates.

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:41.540
The most important thing to you is the Huang family.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:47.180
Am I right? 
 If that's the case, you can't be Kajika's husband.

00:15:48.200 --> 00:15:52.340
Come to think of it, Harry was giving me a challenge.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:58.420
I threw away the Huang name, and I chose Kajika.

00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.230
I didn't hesitate to make that choice.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:08.650
But, look at me now. 
 I'm about to betray Kajika, like this!

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.570
Lee-Leng, give me your hand.

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:18.010
I leave Kajika up to you.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.930
The two tried to leave Kajika to me.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.230
But, I---

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.390
On top of that---

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.490
I thought that was going to be the end.

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:39.990
But, I didn't want it to end like that.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:45.090
I just wanted to see one more person!

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:52.100
When I thought that, your face popped up Lee-Leng!

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:55.090
Kajika!

00:16:59.390 --> 00:17:03.660
I--- am such a fool!

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:10.700
Master Lee-Leng, I brought you some tea.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.020
Xiao-Ying, I have a favor to ask you.

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:29.110
What is it? 
 If I can be of any help to you, I will do anything.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:34.370
Can you call Uncle Tonsen, for me?

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:38.510
Tell him I want to speak to him directly.

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:44.940
Please keep this a secret from Zao. 
 Kajika's life may be in danger.

00:17:48.570 --> 00:17:54.530
- Yes, sir. I will immediately call Master Tonsen. 
- Also...

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:59.560
...can you bake me some cinnamon rolls?

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:04.180
Oh! Of course!

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:13.610
Harry. The game isn't over quite yet!

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:30.430
You're done talking to my grandfather, right?
 Go home now.

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:34.540
It's unfortunate about Quinza.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:39.570
It seems like Lee-Leng Huang is getting married.

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:43.970
How unfortunate. 
 It's too late for you to regret it.

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:46.580
Right, I don't want to regret anything.

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:51.770
- That's why I'm going back to get him! 
- What?!

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:54.480
I'm going to get Lee-Leng back!

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:59.710
How foolish.
 What can you do now?

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:04.520
Do you think with the Burnsworths' help you can do something?

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:08.910
The Burnsworth name is out of this. 
 I just cut ties with them a few minutes ago!

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:20.090
I'll bring Lee-Leng back, so wait for me!

00:19:26.240 --> 00:19:28.500
<i>You're telling me to wait?!</i>

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.990
<i>What a disrespectful girl.</i>

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.530
Master Kajika!

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:48.790
Toranosuke.

00:19:50.930 --> 00:19:54.810
- What's up?! 
- I'm going with you!

00:19:55.260 --> 00:20:01.220
- Toranosuke!
- If I leave you alone, I don't know what you'll do!

00:20:03.920 --> 00:20:05.830
What did Master Najayra say?

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:11.250
How cute of her to talk to me full of sarcasm.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:14.280
We'll be able to become friends one day.

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:22.140
Alright, let's go to the airport!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.850
Toranosuke, let me borrow some money for the taxi.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:31.190
And, let me also borrow the airfare to Singapore! 
 I'll pay you back when I move up in life!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.760
Master Kajika, you have no money on you?

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:37.850
You're too irresponsible!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.650
Hey you there, you need a ride to the airport?!

00:20:47.530 --> 00:20:49.980
- Mustafa! 
 - Eugene-san!

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:54.950
If it's your wish I'll take you to Singapore.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:01.870
- Did you hear about Lee-Leng?! 
- I heard it on the news.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:05.240
So, what are you going to do?

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:10.630
What do you want me to do? 
 Tell me.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:14.890
I will give you what you want.

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:20.910
I want Lee-Leng.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:25.980
Alright, I'll give him to you.

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:33.910
When I heard the news, I thought you'd be in tears.

00:21:36.300 --> 00:21:38.690
I don't want you to suffer like this.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:42.610
I'll give him to you if that's the case.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:44.810
Mustafa.

00:21:50.440 --> 00:21:52.670
I was supposed to die when I was twenty.

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:59.680
You were the one that named me "Mustafa."

00:22:01.620 --> 00:22:03.760
You gave me life.

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:10.770
But, you love someone else.

00:22:13.510 --> 00:22:18.540
I don't care if that's the case. 
 I'm not looking for joy.

00:22:20.990 --> 00:22:24.180
You will even cry for me.

00:22:25.010 --> 00:22:27.140
By your compassion...

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:29.690
...I will be hurt deeper.

00:22:31.980 --> 00:22:34.850
But, that's what I was wishing for.

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:40.650
Our tie forged in sorrow...

00:22:41.760 --> 00:22:45.040
...will continue until one of us passes away.

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
